#: src/app/[locale]/[...slug]/life.tsx:64
msgid "From scratch did he organize the Galician Music Society. He laid the foundation under professional music education in Lviv, starting Music School in 1839 and, a few years later, a Conservatoire, which works till the present days, now under the name of the Lviv National Music Academy. During over fifty years of his public activity, Jan Ruckgaber educated three generations of musicians and music-lovers and earned respect and admiration of Lviv musical circles."
msgstr "From scratch did he organize the Galician Music Society. He laid the foundation under professional music education in Lviv, starting Music School in 1839 and, a few years later, a Conservatoire, which works till the present days, now under the name of the Lviv National Music Academy. During over fifty years of his public activity, Jan Ruckgaber educated three generations of musicians and music-lovers and earned respect and admiration of Lviv musical circles."

