#: src/app/[locale]/[...slug]/life.tsx:37
msgid "In 1826 Ruckgaber settled in Lviv for good. He played concerts, worked as a piano tutor, and a composer.  His music was then published by Franz Piller’s printing house in Lviv. It was mainly dance music, romances and songs."
msgstr "In 1826 Ruckgaber settled in Lviv for good. He played concerts, worked as a piano tutor, and a composer.  His music was then published by Franz Piller’s printing house in Lviv. It was mainly dance music, romances and songs."

#: src/app/[locale]/[...slug]/galicianMusicSociety.tsx:131
msgid ""
"In 1906, the GMS and the Conservatoire moved to a new building,\n"
"              and in 1910 a new concert hall, with excellent acoustics and new\n"
"              organ was put into use. Presently the Lviv Philharmonic is placed\n"
"              there."
msgstr ""
"In 1906, the GMS and the Conservatoire moved to a new building,\n"
"              and in 1910 a new concert hall, with excellent acoustics and new\n"
"              organ was put into use. Presently the Lviv Philharmonic is placed\n"
"              there."

#: src/app/[locale]/[...slug]/galicianMusicSociety.tsx:81
msgid ""
"In November 1848, due to a shellfire of the town, the center of\n"
"              Lviv was seriously damaged. The university building and its\n"
"              library, with valuable Polish materials and antique books, were\n"
"              burnt down, the same happened with the technical university, the\n"
"              town hall and the theatre.  The Galician Music Society suspended\n"
"              its activity."
msgstr ""
"In November 1848, due to a shellfire of the town, the center of\n"
"              Lviv was seriously damaged. The university building and its\n"
"              library, with valuable Polish materials and antique books, were\n"
"              burnt down, the same happened with the technical university, the\n"
"              town hall and the theatre.  The Galician Music Society suspended\n"
"              its activity."

#: src/app/[locale]/[...slug]/music.tsx:87
msgid ""
"In the composer’s oeuvre there are numerous large forms: sonatas,\n"
"              duos, concertos for solo instruments with the accompaniment of the\n"
"              piano, orchestral and choral compositions. There are also piano\n"
"              works for four hands, and even for eight hands."
msgstr ""
"In the composer’s oeuvre there are numerous large forms: sonatas,\n"
"              duos, concertos for solo instruments with the accompaniment of the\n"
"              piano, orchestral and choral compositions. There are also piano\n"
"              works for four hands, and even for eight hands."

#: src/app/[locale]/[...slug]/galicianMusicSociety.tsx:25
msgid ""
"In the early 1830s, Jan Ruckgaber and Franz Xavier Mozart set up\n"
"              the Society of Friends of Music (Gesellschaft der Musikfreunde),\n"
"              which soon became a foundation for the Galician Music Society,\n"
"              officially registered on the 14th of August 1838."
msgstr ""
"In the early 1830s, Jan Ruckgaber and Franz Xavier Mozart set up\n"
"              the Society of Friends of Music (Gesellschaft der Musikfreunde),\n"
"              which soon became a foundation for the Galician Music Society,\n"
"              officially registered on the 14th of August 1838."

#: src/app/[locale]/[...slug]/galicianMusicSociety.tsx:176
msgid ""
"In the year 2004, the institution, once established by Jan\n"
"              Ruckgaber, celebrated its 150th anniversary."
msgstr ""
"In the year 2004, the institution, once established by Jan\n"
"              Ruckgaber, celebrated its 150th anniversary."

#: src/app/[locale]/[...slug]/galicianMusicSociety.tsx:103
msgid ""
"It was not before June 1852, when the Galician Music Society was\n"
"              renewed as The Society for the Development of Music in Galicia.\n"
"              The Society’s concert activity was soon restarted and under\n"
"              Ruckgaber’s direction the orchestra presented to the audience,\n"
"              among others, the overture to &quot;The Summer Night’s Dream&quot;\n"
"              by F. Mendelssohn, and The Pastoral Symphony by L. van\n"
"              Beethoven."
msgstr ""
"It was not before June 1852, when the Galician Music Society was\n"
"              renewed as The Society for the Development of Music in Galicia.\n"
"              The Society’s concert activity was soon restarted and under\n"
"              Ruckgaber’s direction the orchestra presented to the audience,\n"
"              among others, the overture to &quot;The Summer Night’s Dream&quot;\n"
"              by F. Mendelssohn, and The Pastoral Symphony by L. van\n"
"              Beethoven."

